WEBVTT

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:03.680
Alright.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.560
Board of selectmen is coming out of executive

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.160
session at 09:41.

00:00:13.115 --> 00:00:15.515
I'm gonna make a motion to,

00:00:15.995 --> 00:00:17.435
increase

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:18.235
all

00:00:18.555 --> 00:00:19.435
nonunion

00:00:19.435 --> 00:00:21.115
town employee,

00:00:22.235 --> 00:00:24.795
pay rates by 4%

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.390
with the following exceptions.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.830
We want to increase the

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.030
child,

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.550
children's librarian rate to $19.32,

00:00:38.715 --> 00:00:41.195
And we would like to increase

00:00:41.195 --> 00:00:41.915
the,

00:00:43.355 --> 00:00:44.555
rate for

00:00:45.035 --> 00:00:46.315
the senior

00:00:46.315 --> 00:00:48.395
busing transportation,

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:54.140
employee, Ellie Scoo, to $20.94.

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:06.860
Is that it, Jeff? That's it. That's it on the the rates,

00:01:07.555 --> 00:01:12.275
and we just have another motion that we're gonna make after this. I'll second that then, Jeff.

00:01:12.675 --> 00:01:15.155
Okay. Further discussion on any of those items?

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:18.115
All those in favor, aye.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:20.500
Aye.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:21.620
Alright.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.380
And then I

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:27.060
would like to make a motion that

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:30.900
in this current fiscal year

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.500
that

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.140
we

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:36.020
provide a performance

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.955
bonus to

00:01:39.115 --> 00:01:43.035
to mister Bell, the town custodian of $1,500

00:01:43.435 --> 00:01:45.755
for the excellent work that he is

00:01:45.995 --> 00:01:48.155
he has done and is currently doing

00:01:48.635 --> 00:01:50.955
related to the upkeep of the town hall.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.160
I'll second.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.520
Alright. Further discussion on that item?

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:02.920
All those in favor, aye. Aye. Aye.

00:02:04.145 --> 00:02:04.945
Okay.

00:02:07.425 --> 00:02:15.025
I think that's it for tonight. So we have till next Monday. And then Eric, you will sit there and as we have requested, provide

00:02:15.425 --> 00:02:21.290
updated budget summary, and then we can sit there and review it and final next week before

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.130
we pass it on to the Board Finance.

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:25.930
Okay.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:30.810
Anybody?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.410
Motion to adjourn.

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:34.832
Second.

00:02:35.392 --> 00:02:37.872
Okay. All all in favor. Aye.

00:02:37.872 --> 00:02:39.472
Aye. Thank you very much.

00:02:39.872 --> 00:02:41.392
Good night. Good night.
